Negative control for the per-row capability gate (C11).

Ignores the action's declared RULE, so every control renders live on every row
— the defect where the UI offers Remove on a row the API says cannot be
deleted, and the user learns the business rule from a server rejection.

Apply from the repo root: `git apply <this file>`; revert with `git apply -R`.

Reds: list-surface-capability-gate.spec.ts — the `meta.canDelete === false`
case (the control must be disabled).

